        <a href="#custom-action" class="docs-nav-title">5. Custom Action</a>
        <ul class="docs-nav-list">
          <li><a href="#custom-action-build" class="docs-nav-link">5.1. Create an Action</a></li>
          <li><a href="#custom-action-lifecycle" class="docs-nav-link">5.2. Engine Lifecycle</a></li>
          <li><a href="#custom-action-shapecheck" class="docs-nav-link">5.3. Write the Shape Check</a></li>
          <li><a href="#custom-action-processing" class="docs-nav-link">5.4. Prepared Data &amp; Processing</a></li>
          <li><a href="#custom-action-composite" class="docs-nav-link">5.5. Composite Inputs &amp; Outputs</a></li>
          <li><a href="#custom-action-package" class="docs-nav-link">5.6. Build, Package &amp; Import</a></li>
