            </div>
            <pre class="doc-code-pre"><code><span class="tok-comment"># 1. Unconstrained: Any resolution, channel count, or memory layout accepted</span>
<span class="tok-keyword">accept</span> <span class="tok-type">Image</span> <span class="tok-var">$img_in</span>

<span class="tok-comment"># 2. 3-channel RGB/BGR in HWC format (or Image[3, *, *] for planar CHW format)</span>
